{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "cs-supabase-v2-2026",
    "name": "CitySecure — Supabase (Production)",
    "description": "Colección para probar el backend CitySecure apuntando a Railway + Supabase (PostgreSQL).\n\n**URL base:** `https://citysecbackendsupabase-production.up.railway.app/api/v1`\n\n**Dialecto activo en Railway:** `DB_DIALECT=postgres`, `DB_SCHEMA=citysecure`\n\n---\n\n**Flujo básico:**\n1. Ejecutar `POST /auth/login` → token se guarda automáticamente en `{{token}}`\n2. Usar el resto de carpetas directamente\n\n**Coordenadas de prueba:** Chorrillos, Lima, Perú\n`lat: -12.1628 · lng: -77.0135`\n\n**Ambiente recomendado:** `CitySecure — Supabase` (incluido en este repo como `CitySecure_Supabase.postman_environment.json`)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://citysecbackendsupabase-production.up.railway.app/api/v1",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "URL base de la API con versión. Apunta al servicio Railway con Supabase."
    },
    {
      "key": "host",
      "value": "https://citysecbackendsupabase-production.up.railway.app",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Host base sin path. Usado para el healthcheck liviano GET /health (fuera de /api/v1)."
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT de acceso. Se llena automáticamente al ejecutar POST /auth/login."
    },
    {
      "key": "refresh_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT de refresco. Se llena automáticamente al ejecutar POST /auth/login."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "description": "Autenticación JWT. Ejecutar primero — el token se guarda automáticamente en `{{token}}`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (guarda token automáticamente)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login responde 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "let json = {};",
                  "try { json = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
                  "",
                  "const accessToken  = json?.data?.accessToken  || json?.accessToken;",
                  "const refreshToken = json?.data?.refreshToken || json?.refreshToken;",
                  "",
                  "if (accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('token', accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', accessToken);",
                  "  pm.test('Access token guardado', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(accessToken).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "  });",
                  "  console.log('✅ accessToken guardado:', accessToken.substring(0, 40) + '...');",
                  "} else {",
                  "  pm.test('Access token presente', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect.fail('No se encontró accessToken — revisar credenciales o respuesta');",
                  "  });",
                  "  console.error('❌ Respuesta sin token:', JSON.stringify(json));",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "if (refreshToken) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('refresh_token', refreshToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', refreshToken);",
                  "  console.log('✅ refreshToken guardado');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username_or_email\": \"admin@citysec.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin123!\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Inicia sesión con las credenciales del administrador.\n\nEl script post-request guarda automáticamente:\n- `{{token}}` ← `data.accessToken`\n- `{{refresh_token}}` ← `data.refreshToken`\n\n**Credenciales iniciales tras seed RBAC:**\n- email: `admin@citysec.com`\n- password: `Admin123!`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Refresh responde 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "let json = {};",
                  "try { json = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
                  "",
                  "const newToken = json?.data?.accessToken || json?.accessToken;",
                  "if (newToken) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('token', newToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', newToken);",
                  "  console.log('✅ Nuevo accessToken guardado:', newToken.substring(0, 40) + '...');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Genera un nuevo `accessToken` usando el `refreshToken`.\n\nEl script post-request actualiza `{{token}}` automáticamente con el nuevo access token.\n\n**Requisito:** ejecutar Login primero para tener `{{refresh_token}}` disponible."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Logout responde 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Confirma logout', function () {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Limpiar tokens del ambiente",
                  "pm.environment.set('token', '');",
                  "pm.environment.set('refresh_token', '');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', '');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', '');",
                  "console.log('🔒 Tokens borrados del ambiente');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Cierra la sesión revocando todos los refresh tokens activos del usuario.\n\nEl script post-request limpia `{{token}}` y `{{refresh_token}}` del ambiente.\n\n**Requiere:** `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Tracking GPS",
      "description": "Endpoints del módulo de rastreo GPS en tiempo real.\n\nPermisos RBAC necesarios:\n- `tracking.vehiculos.update` → POST /ubicacion\n- `tracking.vehiculos.read`  → GET activos, vehiculos-cercanos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Actualizar posición GPS",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Retorna vehiculo_id y coordenadas', function () {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true;",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('vehiculo_id');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('lat');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('lng');",
                  "  console.log('Posición actualizada — vehiculo_id:', json.data.vehiculo_id,",
                  "    '| lat:', json.data.lat, '| lng:', json.data.lng);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"vehiculo_id\": 26,\n  \"lat\": -12.1628,\n  \"lng\": -77.0135,\n  \"velocidad\": 45.0,\n  \"precision_gps\": 8.5,\n  \"bateria_dispositivo\": 80\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/tracking/ubicacion",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["tracking", "ubicacion"]
            },
            "description": "Recibe y persiste la posición GPS actual del vehículo ID=26.\n\nHace UPSERT en `citysecure.tracking_vehiculos` e INSERT en `citysecure.tracking_historial`.\nEmite evento SSE `vehiculo:posicion` al dashboard.\n\n**Rate limit:** 1 req / 3 s por `vehiculo_id`\n\n**Permiso RBAC:** `tracking.vehiculos.update`\n\n**Coordenadas:** Chorrillos, Lima (lat: -12.1628, lng: -77.0135)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar vehículos activos",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Retorna array de vehiculos', function () {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true;",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('vehiculos');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.vehiculos).to.be.an('array');",
                  "  console.log('Vehículos activos (últimos 10 min):', json.data.total ?? json.data.vehiculos.length);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
